.el .ds Aq '
.TH dslite-b4-set-aftr 8  "set-aftr "
.SH NAME
dslite\-b4\-set\-aftr \- Set the runtime AFTR override and ask the daemon to reconcile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdslite\-b4 set\-aftr\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIADDRESS\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the runtime AFTR override and ask the daemon to reconcile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR [default: /etc/dslite\-b4.toml]
Read configuration from this path
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIADDRESS\fR>
AFTR IPv6 address or DNS name
